  attribute pbt:String="One existing root-task.scm/Make target with six families: RC/VM/BANK/STACK/SYMKEY control plus actual continuation histories. Fresh p1 immediate-only SYMKEY child snapshots C inputs, sets anchors FAL, invokes real task/scanner, then _Exit without Scheme allocation/lookup/callback/return. Separate exclusive single-VM p1 positive control registers old tables as RC roots, admits two small MOVABLE0 empty valid table vectors, installs them only for explicit native GC, then restores originals from RC and releases handles before any Scheme lookup/allocation/callback/return. Actual anchors must both relocate; later ordinary GC/lookup must preserve original interned identity. Production permanent allocation unchanged. Initial full-table-copy relocation assertion failed because symbol vector length2049 was STILL(type5); keyword length129 and small length2 were MOVABLE0(type0). Failure retained; final fixture-only delta reuses exact unchanged production bootstrap/artifacts. Labeled stale-finish/wrong-resume invocation mutations calibrate real replay and deletion1-minimal shrink, not runtime defect claims or exhaustive concurrent schedules.";
  attribute progress:String="One bounded leaf after stack. Globals task/full census and cross-VM registry lifetime still open before independent worker/arena/restoration work. Local component delivery, original whole-check failures, twelve acceptance families and remote CI are separate. No inherited repair numerator/12 or runtime speedup claim.";
